  "notes": "{定|さだ}める is formal and used in official/legal contexts.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: Transitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧)\n- Intransitive pair: ⟦{定|さだ}まる→定まる：12273_sadamaru⟧ (to be established, to be decided)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{法律|ほうりつ}→法律：01722_houritsu⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{定|さだ}める: to stipulate by law\n- ⟦{基準|きじゅん}→基準：00228_kijun⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{定|さだ}める: to set standards\n- ⟦{規則|きそく}→規則：01382_kisoku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{定|さだ}める: to establish rules\n- ⟦{目標|もくひょう}→目標：03631_mokuhyou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{定|さだ}める: to set a goal\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {定|さだ}める: to establish, stipulate (formal, official)\n- ⟦{決|き}める→決める：00858_kimeru⟧: to decide (general, everyday)",
